### New-flow registration against a LOCAL esthesis EDGE pointed at the Enedis sandbox:
### autorisation_id=11 resolves to PRM 14000000000001 via subscribed_services. Expect the
### registration-successful page IF the ITC mocks accept that PRM (see RUNBOOK.md — the sandbox
### ITC mocks only answer for 11111111111111/99999999999999, so this may fail at
### situation_contrat_auto with a 500 + error page; that failure still validates the exchange).
GET localhost:{{API_PORT}}/enedis/public/redirect-handler?code=123&State=1&autorisation_id=11

### autorisation_id=10 — no subscribed services. Expect 400 "Invalid autorisation_id.".
GET localhost:{{API_PORT}}/enedis/public/redirect-handler?code=123&State=1&autorisation_id=10

### autorisation_id=13 — services all TERMINE; our ACTIF filter finds none. Expect 400.
GET localhost:{{API_PORT}}/enedis/public/redirect-handler?code=123&State=1&autorisation_id=13

### Non-numeric autorisation_id. Expect 400.
GET localhost:{{API_PORT}}/enedis/public/redirect-handler?code=123&State=1&autorisation_id=abc

### Neither usage_point_id nor autorisation_id. Expect 400 "Missing usage_point_id or autorisation_id.".
GET localhost:{{API_PORT}}/enedis/public/redirect-handler?code=123&State=1

### Legacy flow with a mock PRM the ITC mocks accept — full happy path against the sandbox.
GET localhost:{{API_PORT}}/enedis/public/redirect-handler?code=123&State=1&usage_point_id=99999999999999
